OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe west will see rain through
OL,6,Fthe day, heavy at times. Drier in east
OL,7,FHighland with patchy rain at times and
OL,8,Fthe odd brighter spell. Fresh strong
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with rain, heavy and
OL,12,Fpersistent in the west but drier
OL,13,Faround Inverness and Nairn. Rain
OL,14,Fclears southeast through the early
OL,15,Fhours with clear spells and scattered
OL,16,Fshowers following.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
