OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,6,Fand a few scattered showers. The
OL,7,Fshowers turning more frequent for
OL,8,FCaithness and Sutherland later in the
OL,9,Fafternoon where it will be rather
OL,10,Fbreezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FAny
OL,13,Fshowers clearing during Monday to
OL,14,Fleave most places dry with sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Mainly dry on Tuesday and
OL,16,FWednesday except for the risk of
OL,17,Fshowery rain for the Western Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
